**Step 1 – 确定跳步速度**

跳步速度是每小时2英里。

\[
v_{\text{jump}} = 2\ \text{km/h}
\]

**Step 2 – 确定走速度**

跳步速度是走速度的半部分，所以

\[
v_{\text{walk}} = 2\,v_{\text{jump}} = 2\times2 = 4\ \text{km/h}。
\]

**Step 3 – 确定走速度**

走速度是走速度的四倍，所以

\[
v_{\text{run}} = 4\,v_{\text{walk}} = 4\times4 = 16\ \text{km/h}。
\]

**步骤4 – 确定时间**

总时间是8分钟，半时间是4分钟，半时间是4分钟。

\[
t_{\text{run}} = t_{\text{walk}} = \frac{8}{2}=4\ \text{分钟}。
\]

**步骤5 – 计算距离**

\[
\begin{aligned}
距离（走）&= v_{\text{walk}}\times t_{\text{walk}}
               = 4\ \text{km/h}\times\frac{4}{60}\ \text{h}
               = \frac{16}{60}\ \text{km}
               = \frac{4}{15}\ \text{km},\\[4pt]
距离（跳步）&= v_{\text{jump}}\times t_{\text{jump}}
               = 2\ \text{km/h}\times\frac{4}{60}\ \text{h}
               = \frac{8}{60}\ \text{km}
               = \frac{2}{15}\ \text{km}.
\end{aligned}
\]

**步骤6 – 总距离**

\[
\begin{aligned}
总距离 &= \frac{4}{15}\ \text{km} + \frac{2}{15}\ \text{km}
               = \frac{6}{15}\ \text{km}
               = \frac{2}{5}\ \text{km}
               = 0.4\ \text{km}.
\end{aligned}
\]

\[
\boxed{0.4}
